cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or dataset, please cite the article in
  preferred-citation below.
title: >-
  KBDiag evaluation: code and data for automated testing and debugging of
  configuration knowledge bases with direct diagnosis
type: software
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for the article "Automated Testing and Debugging of
  Configuration Knowledge Bases With Direct Diagnosis". Contains the Python
  implementation of the KBDiag (MSSDirect) algorithm and the HSDAG+QuickXPlain
  baseline, six configuration knowledge bases in UVL format, the generated test
  suites and scenarios, the raw evaluation results, and the scripts that
  regenerate every result table in the article.
